# fu17-simulate.keys — league CALENDAR "Simulate" press (FU-17 retry, 2026-10-02).
#
# One AUTOTYPE step (comma = 0.2 s; see docs/ghidra/FU13_headless_input.md).
# Prefix is the FU-16 run-B / FU-17 flow-6 league route, re-verified in
# captures/session-probe-sim-1 and session-probe-sim-2:
#   10 s  enter        skip the looping intro
#   18 s  down         GAME SELECT: Friendly -> Leagues
#   22 s  enter        open LEAGUE SELECT
#   30 s  enter        International -> LEAGUE TEAM SELECT
#   40 s  enter        open the "Are you Sure?" dialog on a country
#   46 s  enter        confirm the country (checkbox sticks)
#   56 s  down, 60/66 s enter
#                      walk the team-select dialog (unlocks bottom Play)
#   70 s  down
#   74/78/82 s right   focus the bottom Play button
#   86 s  enter        open the LEAGUE CALENDAR (August fixture list)
#  104 s  down         calendar focus -> Today button (frame 004-0105)
#  116 s  down         Today -> Simulate (frame 004-0122)
#  132 s  enter        run the season simulation -> "League Champions" dialog
#  160 s  enter        dismiss the dialog -> "Season Over" calendar with scores
#
# Frame-verified outcome (both retry runs): Enter on Simulate completes the
# season instantly (random champion: Spain in run 1, Brazil in run 2), and the
# second Enter returns to the calendar with all fixtures scored, "Season Over"
# and Simulate greyed. It does NOT start a competition match: T_PROBE site=9
